      "role": "primary",
      "technique": "Tensile/compressive force testing during thermal activation",
      "why": "A universal mechanical testing frame can accurately monitor the blocking or recovery force exerted by a pre-deformed polymer sample held at fixed displacement while recovery is triggered.",
      "accessories_to_confirm": [
        "Environmental / temperature chamber",
